# Do not publish to npm

This repository is private (`AlconicLLC/clio-mcp`). Releases are git tags and GitHub Releases only.

- Never run `npm publish`, and never publish `@oktopeak/clio-mcp` or any other package from this fork.
- `package.json` stays `"private": true`. Do not remove it.
- Keep saying the version is not published to npm in GitHub Release notes.
- The public npm package `@oktopeak/clio-mcp` belongs to Oktopeak. Do not treat a version here as something to upload there.
